  "description": "An MCP (Model Context Protocol) server for GhidraSharp: headless Ghidra reverse-engineering exposed as stdio tools an LLM agent drives directly (open a program, find strings, walk xrefs, decompile, chase the call chain, read bytes, record findings). Install as a dotnet tool: ghidrasharp-mcp. Needs a ghidrasharp-server (Const24.GhidraSharp.Server or the Release zip), a Ghidra 12.1+ install, and JDK 21+.",
